        // Now count numbers with exactly k bits that are <= n and have exactly one zero
        // These numbers have k bits, MSB is 1, and exactly one of the remaining (k-1) bits is 0

        // Let's iterate over possible positions of the zero (from position 0 to k-2, where position k-1 is MSB)
